estinations, means of transport, use of public transport passes, reasons of trips. Wave 2 (1991) and 3 (1992) are partly replications of the first wave in 1990. Additional questions: changes in car ownership and place of residence \/ use of public transport during holidays in the Netherlands \/ changes in travel patterns. Background variables: basic characteristics\/ household characteristics\/ education\/ consumption of durables"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Other"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"policy"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"consumption"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"students"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"transport"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"youth"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1990-11-19"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"F. Cheung, Ministerie van Verkeer en Waterstaat, Adviesdienst Verkeer en Vervoer (depositor)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ministerie van verkeer en waterstaat * Den Haag Directoraat generaal voor het vervoer (research initiator)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Veldkamp marktonderzoek bv * Amsterdam (data collector)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-07-11"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typ